{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "错误的瓶装水  (The Wrong Bottled Water)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Just as Chun Yuqiao returns from the hospital, Xingzi discovers a new crisis: a viral red-carpet video posted by Xin Huimei's fan club clearly shows the wrong sponsor's bottled water backstage. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，你从医院回来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "萧尧和吕怡那边是什么态度？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，这个事你先别管了，他们今天上传了一条视频。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是粉丝在盛典那一天拿手机跟拍的，这应该是粉丝福利吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是电视台那天弄错了冠名商的产品摆放。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大及时发现以后，才没有让错误的瓶装水出现在电视画面里。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看，爱美会的自制视频里出现了错误的产品，车里、休息室全都有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这播放量还挺高的呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没错，很多粉丝已经转发了，影响力已经扩散了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "邓主任已经放下身段来拜托我们，你联系一下粉红哥看看怎么沟通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，请问是许天泽粉红哥吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，你从医院回来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, you are back from the hospital?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "萧尧和吕怡那边是什么态度？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What attitude are Xiao Yao and Lv Yi taking?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，这个事你先别管了，他们今天上传了一条视频。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, set that aside first; they uploaded a video today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是粉丝在盛典那一天拿手机跟拍的，这应该是粉丝福利吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fans filmed it on a phone during the gala; that must be a perk for fans, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是电视台那天弄错了冠名商的产品摆放。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet that day the network misplaced the title sponsor's product display.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大及时发现以后，才没有让错误的瓶装水出现在电视画面里。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only because our boss caught it in time did the wrong bottled water stay off television.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看，爱美会的自制视频里出现了错误的产品，车里、休息室全都有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look, the wrong product shows up in the fan club's video, both in the car and in the lounge.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这播放量还挺高的呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The view count on this is pretty high!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没错，很多粉丝已经转发了，影响力已经扩散了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Exactly; many fans have reposted it already, and its reach has spread.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "邓主任已经放下身段来拜托我们，你联系一下粉红哥看看怎么沟通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Deng swallowed his pride to ask our help, so contact Brother Fenhong and see how to talk it through.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，请问是许天泽粉红哥吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, may I ask if this is Xu Tianze, Brother Fenhong?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，你从医院回来了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "萧尧和吕怡那边是什么态度？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，这个事你先别管了，他们今天上传了一条视频。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是粉丝在盛典那一天拿手机跟拍的，这应该是粉丝福利吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "可是电视台那天弄错了冠名商的产品摆放。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大及时发现以后，才没有让错误的瓶装水出现在电视画面里。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看，爱美会的自制视频里出现了错误的产品，车里、休息室全都有。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这播放量还挺高的呢！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "没错，很多粉丝已经转发了，影响力已经扩散了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "邓主任已经放下身段来拜托我们，你联系一下粉红哥看看怎么沟通。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，请问是许天泽粉红哥吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "To help DTS avoid heavy sponsor penalties, Xiaogu picks up the phone to set a meeting with Huimei's fan-club president. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
